      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-03-05T15:45:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, that was insane.</p><p>We got&nbsp;through issue 1.&nbsp; Every. Single. Attack. From Legacy emulated a port in some fashion.</p><p>His first attack: Can I throw one spider-bot into a second, banking the second into a third?&nbsp;</p><p>His second attack: Bowling for Spiderbots!</p><p>His third: Can I Slide one of these on the ice AZ just created and then race ahead of it with a broom?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Other standouts: Unity rolling a 3 trying to crash an impromptu conveyance bot into the Spider Mothership.</p><p>Tachyon wiping up the entirety of the first wave with Hypersonic assault after some tips from Wraith.</p><p>Absolute Zero Saving a bunch of Cocooned peeps with a very creative usage of ice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:46:13.393Z",
