      "created_at": "2018-03-07T22:00:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Somewhere in these threads is one where someone suggested using index cards to track the bad guys and the various tasks that are on the table for the PC.&nbsp; The idea is to literally put them on the table.&nbsp; \"Three spider bots for you\"...GM lays card on table with 3 spider bots...etc.&nbsp; Gosh that seemed like a good idea to me.&nbsp; I plan to do that when I run it.&nbsp; ;)</p>",
